<!--
  Download.

  Replaces @android:drawable/stat_sys_download and stat_sys_download_done,
  which are STATUS BAR assets: drawn small, drawn for a notification strip,
  and never intended to sit inside a button at 18dp. The "done" variant was
  worse than wrong-sized — it shows a completed download on a control that
  has not been pressed yet.

  An arrow into a tray, which is what the button does. Same 24dp grid, single
  filled path.
-->
